      "description": "<p>DPX Electronics Case v1.1.0</p>\n<p>Changes</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Added <code>config/config.json</code>.</li>\n<li>Added configurable external case size.</li>\n<li>Added configurable internal grid size.</li>\n<li>Added configurable price.</li>\n<li>Added configurable trader and loyalty level.</li>\n<li>Added configurable accepted categories and accepted items.</li>\n<li>Kept the full Electronics category as the default filter.</li>\n<li>Icon, model, prefab and bundle are not configurable.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Default Settings</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Trader: Skier</li>\n<li>Loyalty level: 1</li>\n<li>Price: 250000 roubles</li>\n<li>External size: 3x3</li>\n<li>Internal grid: 10x10</li>\n<li>Default filter: Electronics category</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Compatibility</p>\n<ul>\n<li>SPT 4.0.13</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Install</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Download the archive.</li>\n<li>Extract it.</li>\n<li>Copy the <code>SPT</code> folder over your SPT installation folder.</li>\n<li>The mod should end up here:</li>\n</ol>\n<p><code>SPT/user/mods/DPX-ElectronicsCase/</code></p>\n<p>Important</p>\n<p>Avoid reducing the internal grid size after storing items inside the case.</p>\n",
